         "text": "Differentiate both sides of \\( - x^{3} + y^{2} = 1 \\) with respect to \\( t \\), using the chain rule on each term: \\( \\left(- 3 x^{2}\\right)\\frac{dx}{dt} + \\left(2 y\\right)\\frac{dy}{dt} = 0 \\).",
